dment", "explain": "A vote on a proposed change, not on the bill itself.", "vote": null, "title": "", "refs": ["S. 4035"], "pending": true, "source": "Senate Daily Press Gallery", "notes": []}, {"id": "bs-S4035-3", "chamber": "senate", "ts": "2026-11-19T12:00:00-05:00", "dateonly": true, "text": "Passed Senate with an amendment by Voice Vote.", "refs": [], "source": "Congress.gov", "kind": "amendment", "badge": "AMENDMENT", "label": "Amendment", "explain": "A vote on a proposed change, not on the bill itself.", "vote": {"result": "Passed", "voice": true}}, {"id": "bs-S4035-5", "chamber": "senate", "ts": "2026-11-19T12:00:00-05:00", "dateonly": true, "text": "Measure laid before Senate by unanimous consent.", "refs": [], "source": "Congress.gov", "kind": "info", "badge": "UPDATE", "label": "Update", "explain": "", "vote": null}, {"id": "bs-S4035-6", "chamber": "senate", "ts": "2026-11-19T12:00:00-05:00", "dateonly": true, "text": "Senate Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry discharged by Unanimous Consent.", "refs": [], "source": "Congress.gov", "kind": "info", "badge": "UPDATE", "label": "Update", "explain": "", "vote": null}, {"id": "bs-S4035-8", "chamber": "senate", "ts": "2026-03-10T12:00:00-05:00", "dateonly": true, "text": "Read twice and referred to the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry.", "refs": [], "source": "Congress.gov", "kind": "stage", "badge": "INTRODUCED", "label": "Introduced / sent to committee", "explain": "", "vote": null}], "history_loaded": true}